# Paid Pattern Library payloads — the finished grids and collage project data ARE
# the product, so they never live in this (public) repo. The private master copy
# is /home/team/shared/patterns/grants/ and scripts/build-grant-data.sh stages it
# into the deploy artifact. These paths are ignored so a payload can never be
# re-added by accident.
stitchwise-backend/src/infrastructure/data/pattern-grants.json
